# The sandbox: what it is doing now, what strict adds, and the profile table.
title lmux sandbox
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
run demo-shell
wait 1
type clear
enter
wait 0.5
chapter Sandbox
caption lmux sandbox status | what the sandbox is doing in this project, right now
type lmux sandbox status
enter
wait 2
frame 3.5
caption lmux sandbox show strict | the rules a profile writes, byte for byte
type clear; lmux sandbox show strict | head -26
enter
wait 2
frame 3.5
caption lmux sandbox profiles | what each profile allows and what it blocks
type clear; lmux sandbox profiles
enter
wait 2
frame 4
